[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だいぶ沖のほうまで出たな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've gone pretty far out now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ、船を止めたみたい……あっ！\n見て！\u3000兄さん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, looks like he stopped the boat... Oh! Look!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やはり彼の仕業で間違いないようだ。\n取り押さえるぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So it really was him after all. We're taking him in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこを動くな！\u3000",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Freeze!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海に魔物を捨て、神聖国を騒がせているのはお前だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're the one dumping monsters in the sea and causing all this trouble in Nova, aren't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That's right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "岸に戻れ。事情聴取をさせてもらう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Head back to shore. We need to question you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぜこんなことをしている。街が騒ぎに\nなっていることに、気付いていないわけじゃないだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you doing this? You must realize the whole town is in an uproar over this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "娘さん……のためなんですよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's for your daughter... isn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ああ。そこまで調べているのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So you've figured that much out already."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "病気の娘さんを助けたくて、海に生贄を捧げている。\nそうなんですよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're offering sacrifices to the sea to save your sick daughter. That's it, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "生贄？\u3000なんのことだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacrifices? What are you talking about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海を信仰する集団がいるって聞いたんです。その教えに\n従って、海に魔物を捧げてるんじゃないんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We heard there's a group that worships the sea. You're following their teachings and offering monsters to the sea, aren't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "違う。魔物のために餌をばらまいているだけだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. I'm just using the monsters as bait."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……なんのためにそんなことを？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Bait? For what purpose?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この海域に棲む、ある魔物をおびき寄せたかった。\nそいつの肝が、俺には必要なんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To lure out a specific monster that lives in these waters. I need its liver."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その肝を干して煎じたものが、娘を救う薬になる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When dried and brewed, that liver becomes the medicine that can save my daughter."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000本当なのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Are you certain of this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "間違いない。カロストンまで行って、\nいくつもの本を調べたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Absolutely. I went all the way to Karlston and researched it in countless books."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……俺の行動が、その魔物だけじゃなく色んな魔物を\n集めてしまうことは分かっていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I knew my actions would attract more than just that one monster. I knew it would draw all kinds of creatures."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、俺にはやるしかなかった。\n娘を救うには……それしかない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I had no choice. Saving my daughter... this is the only way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういう……ことだったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that's... what this is about."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キー！\u3000キー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kee! Kee!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000この声は……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! That cry...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "目当ての魔物か！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that the monster you're after!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、兄さん！\u3000それだけじゃないみたい……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, something's wrong! There's more than just that one...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]